-{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","#","^set_variable:debrief_played=true","/#",{"->":"debrief_location"},null],"debrief_location":[["#","^speaker:narrator","/#","^Narrator: SAFETYNET headquarters. The handler's office at four in the morning, the city still lit beyond the glass.","\n","#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Every ENTROPY cell banks at HashChain, and tonight we got the books.","\n","^Agent HaX: We've been chasing cells one at a time. Now we can see who pays them all.","\n","ev","str","^Start with the fund.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What does it give us?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"architects_fund_discussion"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"strategic_impact"},null]}],null],"strategic_impact":[["^Agent HaX: A lot. Every cell's money runs through one mixer, into one fund.","\n","^Agent HaX: Advances first, then the balances, all on one clock. Seventy-two hours from when you found it.","\n","ev","str","^What's left of that clock?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^And the fund?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"operation_disrupted"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"architects_fund_discussion"},null]}],null],"operation_disrupted":["^Agent HaX: Depends what you did with the wallet.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"assets_seized"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You froze it before the payout. When the clock runs out, it runs out on an empty wallet.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You let it run. When the payout goes, every wallet it reaches gets tagged.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"architects_fund_discussion"},{"#f":1}],"architects_fund_discussion":[["ev",{"VAR?":"irina_confirmed_slot"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You traced the fund, and Volkova confirmed the slot. That's how we know she meant it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"console_tripped"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You found the fund by working the console until it gave. It logged every slot you tried, so ENTROPY will know exactly where we looked.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"found_blockchain_evidence"},"!","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You found the slot on the console without Priya's write-up. Lucky, or good. The file will say lucky.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You traced the fund yourself. In through the mixer, out by amount and time.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX: $12.8 million, split across six cells. Every name's on that page.","\n",{"->":"fund_implications"},null],"fund_implications":[["^Agent HaX: Three hundred and fifty to six hundred projected dead across the operations it pays for. The cells' own estimates.","\n","^Agent HaX: They wrote that number down and called it \"The Architect's Masterpiece.\"","\n","ev","str","^How does anyone sign off on that?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What happens to the cells now?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"ideology_discussion"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"cell_disruption"},null]}],null],"ideology_discussion":["^Agent HaX: They think the system's falling anyway, and pushing it saves lives later.","\n","^Agent HaX: Greed I could bargain with. These people believe it.","\n",{"->":"cell_disruption"},null],"cell_disruption":["ev",{"VAR?":"assets_seized"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The freeze doesn't stop the cells that were already paid.","\n","^Agent HaX: And ENTROPY knows we were inside their bank. We won't get in again.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"CNT?":"operation_disrupted"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: They don't know we're watching. Whatever the money buys goes ahead unless we get there first.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Every cell that took a payout is on our map, and they don't know it.","\n","^Agent HaX: They'll have the money in three days. Whatever it buys goes ahead unless we get there first.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"irina_discussion"},null],"irina_discussion":["^Agent HaX: Volkova.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"irina_recruited"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"irina_recruited_path"},{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"irina_arrested"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"irina_arrested_path"},{"->":".^.^.^.12"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"irina_ko_path"},null],"irina_ko_path":[["^Agent HaX: She went down on the trading floor. Fine in a day, the medics say. Charged within a week.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"exchange_infiltrated"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: That's a loss. She had the whole mixer in her head, and she was halfway out of the door.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: We never got a proper conversation out of her. Now we won't.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^She was complicit. She built the thing.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^I didn't decide it. It happened fast.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"read_irina_notes"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: She was, and she knew it. You read her own note asking what she'd become.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: She was. Whether she knew it, we'll have to ask her lawyer.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX: Still a bad trade. We had a cryptographer inside ENTROPY's money. Now we have a defendant.","\n",{"->":"satoshi_aftermath"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: They usually do. I'm not writing you up for it.","\n","^Agent HaX: Log it honestly, though. We lost an asset, and the file says so.","\n",{"->":"satoshi_aftermath"},null]}],null],"irina_recruited_path":[["^Agent HaX: You turned her.","\n","^Agent HaX: She gave us the mixer. Nobody alive knows ENTROPY's plumbing better.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"irina_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And then she went down on the trading floor. I'll be explaining that one upstairs.","\n","^Agent HaX: What she gave us still stands.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Was it the right call?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^She wanted out. I gave her a door.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"recruitment_validation"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"moral_reasoning"},null]}],null],"recruitment_validation":["^Agent HaX: For tonight, yes. What's in her head beats anything on her servers.","\n","^Agent HaX: She's promised the pool keys and the wallet map by tonight, and the account that paid her.","\n",{"->":"recruitment_impact"},null],"moral_reasoning":["^Agent HaX: You read her right. She built it for \"financial freedom\".","\n","^Agent HaX: She'd looked. She just hadn't let herself read it. You made her.","\n",{"->":"recruitment_impact"},null],"recruitment_impact":["^Agent HaX: She came over because she believed you. Remember that when someone asks if she was worth it.","\n",{"->":"irina_how_you_worked_her"},null],"irina_arrested_path":[["^Agent HaX: You detained her and handed her over with the evidence. By the book.","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"irina_ko"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: She went down on the trading floor after you'd detained her. The police carried her out.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"irina_taken"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The police collected her from her desk while you were still working the building.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The police collected her from her desk after you'd gone.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX: The charges are for the police. Laundering, conspiracy, terrorist financing. Long file.","\n","ev","str","^She knew what she was building.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Could I have turned her?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"arrest_justification"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"missed_opportunity"},null]}],null],"arrest_justification":["^Agent HaX: She did. It ran through code she wrote, and she saw the flags.","\n","^Agent HaX: Feeling bad about it doesn't make her less responsible.","\n",{"->":"arrest_impact"},null],"missed_opportunity":["^Agent HaX: Maybe. The profile said she was wavering.","\n","^Agent HaX: A pitch that fails blows the operation. You took the safe route. I won't argue with it.","\n",{"->":"arrest_impact"},null],"arrest_impact":["^Agent HaX: The Crypto Anarchists have lost their best cryptographer. Replacing her will take them months.","\n",{"->":"irina_how_you_worked_her"},null],"irina_how_you_worked_her":["ev",{"VAR?":"irina_badge_cloned"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And you cloned her office badge off her lanyard while she talked. She'll read that in the file one day.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"irina_badge_obtained"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And she lent you her office badge. People don't do that for a regulator they've just met.","\n","^Agent HaX: You never gave it back, by the way. Leave it at the front desk. Evidence will want it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"read_irina_notes"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Reading her notes first was good work. You knew what she'd told herself before you said a word.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"satoshi_aftermath"},null],"satoshi_aftermath":[["ev",{"VAR?":"satoshi_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Satoshi was still out cold on his office floor when extraction walked in. Someone took a photo. I've been asked not to circulate it.","\n","^Agent HaX: He came round in the van and started on financial freedom before they'd finished his rights.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"monitoring_enabled"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: We detained \"Satoshi Nakamoto the Second\" in his own office. The police have him, and nobody outside that van knows it yet.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: We detained \"Satoshi Nakamoto the Second\" in his own office and handed him to the police.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"satoshi_stance"},"str","^wondered","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: He told the arresting officer you'd admitted to wondering. I've left that out of the file.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"satoshi_stance"},"str","^refused","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: He talked about financial freedom all the way through his rights. Said you wouldn't debate him. He took it as a compliment.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: He talked about financial freedom all the way through his rights.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^He'll be making speeches at the trial.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Did he give anything up?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: Let him. The jury will have the allocation.","\n",{"->":"exchange_aftermath"},null],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"architect_identity_found"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Nothing his safe hadn't already told us.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Not a word about The Architect. That's what his safe was for.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"exchange_aftermath"},null]}],null],"exchange_aftermath":["ev",{"VAR?":"assets_seized"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: HashChain's finished and the mixer's dark. Every cell needs a new bank, and they won't trust the next one for months.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The exchange stays open under watch. His payout was pre-signed, so it still goes, and then the police get the rest.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"minder_ko"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His minder's in custody too. He finishes a long career on a corridor floor.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"minder_hostile"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His minder came at you and you went round him. He's in custody now, and furious.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"minder_walked"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His minder read the casualty line and walked out of the building. He isn't in custody. I'd rather he was, but I understand him.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"minder_vouched"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His minder took Volkova's word for you, on the phone, with his boss behind the door.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"minder_passed"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His minder let you walk in. I'd like to hear what you said to him.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"minder_challenged"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His minder turned you back, and you went through his boss's door anyway.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"cover_and_staff"},null],"cover_and_staff":["ev",{"VAR?":"cover_strained"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Your cover didn't last the night. HashChain rang the FCA, and that might cost us the next job.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"satoshi_spoken"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And the cover held on the floor. Only Satoshi thought to check, and by then you were at his desk.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And the cover held. Nobody at HashChain thought to ring the FCA.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"trader_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Okonkwo flagged those wallets before we ever did, and got knocked down for it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"analyst_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Raghavan drew us the money, and woke up on the lab floor.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.17"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard on the checkpoint has a wife who wants to know why he's in A&E.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.23"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"trader_ko"},{"VAR?":"analyst_ko"},"||",{"VAR?":"guard_ko"},"||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: None of them were in on it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.33"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"analyst_told"},{"VAR?":"analyst_ko"},"!","&&","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You went back and told Raghavan what she'd been drawing. Better from you than from a police statement.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.37"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"analyst_walked_through"},{"VAR?":"analyst_ko"},"!","&&","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Raghavan will want to know what she was drawing. Somebody from the police will tell her. I'd rather it was you.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.37"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"password_cracking_discussion"},null],"password_cracking_discussion":[["^Agent HaX: All four flags in.","\n","ev","str","^Walk me through it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^I was there. Skip it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: An analytics service nobody had locked down got you onto their backend. One cracked password, and the same password opened a second account.","\n","^Agent HaX: The financial database gave us their doors, and the vault account gave us the keys to every cold wallet they hold.","\n","^Agent HaX: That's the whole chain, from outside to the keys, and they'd left every link open.","\n",{"->":"fca_letter"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: Short version, then. They left every link open.","\n",{"->":"fca_letter"},null]}],null],"fca_letter":[["ev",{"VAR?":"fca_picks"},0,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"cover_strained"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: One more thing. The FCA wants to know who was using its name tonight, and it wants a letter. Three findings.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: One more thing. You were their regulator tonight, and the FCA wants its letter. Give me the three findings that go in it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_picks"},3,">=","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"fca_verdict"},{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Their door passphrases follow a house rule, and the rule is pinned to a noticeboard.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^The \"current year\" in those passphrases was set once and never changed.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Two service accounts share one password.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^A database account runs the door controllers.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},"ev","str","^Every cold wallet's recovery keys sit on one account.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":20},"ev","str","^An analytics service on their backend nobody had locked down.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":20},"ev","str","^The CEO switched off compliance reporting on the mixer.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":20},"ev","str","^The office badges can be cloned from across a desk.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-7","flg":20},"ev","str","^They trade a lot of Monero.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-8","flg":20},"ev","str","^Their CTO publishes research.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-9","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-4":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-5":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-6":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-7":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_right","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-8":["\n","^Agent HaX: That's legal. Laundering through it isn't, and that's a different letter.","\n",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}],"c-9":["\n","^Agent HaX: That's a CV, not a finding.","\n",{"->":"fca_next"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"fca_next":["ev",{"VAR?":"fca_picks"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"fca_picks","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"fca_letter"},null],"fca_verdict":["ev",{"VAR?":"fca_right"},"/ev",["du","ev",3,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n","^Agent HaX: Three for three. Any one of those would have cost them their licence. Together they explain how you walked in.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],["du","ev",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n","^Agent HaX: Two good ones. Close enough to sign.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","^Agent HaX: One of those would stand up. Read it again before it goes.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"evidence_review"},null],"evidence_review":["ev",{"VAR?":"signing_record_found"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And his signing case. You lifted his thumb off his own press clipping and opened it. The release has one signer, and it's him.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"found_blockchain_evidence"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"evidence_complete"},{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"evidence_partial_fund"},{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n",null],"evidence_complete":["^Agent HaX: Priya's write-up and the fund allocation, both. Wallets, transactions and what they pay for.","\n","^Agent HaX: That's evidence the police can use. People in several cells will face charges over the money.","\n",{"->":"lore_discussion"},null],"evidence_partial_fund":["^Agent HaX: You've got the fund allocation. Without Priya's write-up we're missing a few links.","\n","^Agent HaX: The allocation's the one that matters.","\n",{"->":"lore_discussion"},null],"lore_discussion":["ev",{"VAR?":"architect_identity_found"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"identity_found"},{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"identity_missing"},{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n",null],"identity_found":[["^Agent HaX: And Satoshi's safe. His own notes on who The Architect is.","\n","^Agent HaX: His best guess is Dr Adrian Tesseract. Our chief strategist, once. Walked out seven years ago.","\n","ev","str","^One of ours?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^How much weight does his guess carry?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: Ours. He wrote the training I gave you.","\n",{"->":"tesseract_revelation"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: Eighty-seven per cent, by Satoshi's sum. Satoshi doesn't round up.","\n",{"->":"tesseract_revelation"},null]}],null],"tesseract_revelation":[["^Agent HaX: He left over an argument. He thought the Cyber Security arms race would bring on the collapse it was meant to stop.","\n","ev","str","^So now he's making his own prediction come true.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Do you know him?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"accelerationism_discussion"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"personal_connection"},null]}],null],"accelerationism_discussion":["^Agent HaX: If collapse is coming anyway, you speed it up and pick the terms.","\n","^Agent HaX: He'd call these attacks lessons. I call them attacks.","\n",{"->":"final_assessment"},null],"personal_connection":["^Agent HaX: ...I was one of his students.","\n","^Agent HaX: Best strategic mind I ever met. Most of how I think about this job, I got from him.","\n","^Agent HaX: If it's him... *quietly* Let's leave it there for tonight.","\n",{"->":"final_assessment"},null],"identity_missing":["^Agent HaX: You left Satoshi's safe shut. Whatever he kept in it, the police will open on their schedule, not ours.","\n","^Agent HaX: A man like that keeps insurance. I'd have liked to read it first.","\n",{"->":"final_assessment"},null],"final_assessment":[["^Agent HaX: Here's what worries me.","\n","^Agent HaX: Six cells, one fund, one seventy-two-hour clock. Somebody wrote one schedule for all of them.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"architect_identity_found"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And we may finally have a name for whoever wrote it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^What's next?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^So they all move at once.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: We find out which of them moves first, and get there before it does.","\n",{"->":"next_mission_hint"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: If they do, we won't get much warning.","\n",{"->":"next_mission_hint"},null]}],null],"next_mission_hint":["^Agent HaX: Get some rest. Keep your phone on.","\n","#","^complete_task:hear_debrief","/#","#","^exit_conversation","/#","done",null],"global decl":["ev","str","^Agent 0x00","/str",{"VAR=":"player_name"},false,{"VAR=":"found_blockchain_evidence"},false,{"VAR=":"found_architects_fund"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_recruited"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_arrested"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"satoshi_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"trader_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"analyst_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"architect_identity_found"},false,{"VAR=":"assets_seized"},false,{"VAR=":"monitoring_enabled"},false,{"VAR=":"flag1_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"flag2_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"flag3_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"flag4_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"read_irina_notes"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_badge_obtained"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_badge_cloned"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_confirmed_slot"},false,{"VAR=":"exchange_infiltrated"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"satoshi_stance"},false,{"VAR=":"cover_strained"},false,{"VAR=":"guard_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"minder_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"minder_passed"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_taken"},false,{"VAR=":"minder_hostile"},false,{"VAR=":"satoshi_spoken"},false,{"VAR=":"console_tripped"},false,{"VAR=":"signing_record_found"},false,{"VAR=":"minder_challenged"},false,{"VAR=":"analyst_told"},false,{"VAR=":"analyst_walked_through"},false,{"VAR=":"minder_walked"},false,{"VAR=":"minder_vouched"},0,{"VAR=":"fca_picks"},0,{"VAR=":"fca_right"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}
