g odd goes to Irina. She decides what gets reported.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"suspicious_patterns":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Same habit every time. In, mixed, and gone by midnight.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Three of them have names on. Another twelve million or so since January hasn't.","\n","ev","str","^Where's the money going?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Have you reported this?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"destination_discussion"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"reporting_status"},null]}],null],"destination_discussion":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: That's the weird bit. I lose it in the mixer. But the shape says it all ends up in one place.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Different wallets in, and I'd bet one wallet out. Either someone's pooling it, or...","\n","ev","str","^Or what?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Did you flag this to Irina?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"coordinated_funding"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"irina_flagging"},null]}],null],"coordinated_funding":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Or lots of little groups are paying into one big one.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: That's the shape you get with organised crime. Or worse.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: I hope Irina knows what she's doing with it.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"irina_flagging":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Fortnight ago. She took it off me and did it herself.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Hasn't said what she found. Just \"keep watching\".","\n","ev","str","^Does she seem concerned?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What's your read on it?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"irina_concern"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"analyst_opinion"},null]}],null],"irina_concern":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Hard to tell. Irina's always intense.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: But she's been here till all hours, re-running my w