e},{"b":["\n","ev",1,"/ev",{"VAR=":"irina_news","re":true},"^Priya Raghavan: Someone said Irina's been detained. Was it the graph? Was it my graph?","\n",{"->":"hub.0.4"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Priya Raghavan: ",["ev","visit",3,"%","/ev","ev","du",0,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s0","c":true},"ev","du",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s1","c":true},"ev","du",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s2","c":true},"nop",{"s0":["pop","^What else?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s1":["pop","^Go on.",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s2":["pop","^Anything else?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"#f":5}],"\n",{"->":"hub.0.4"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^How does the forensics side of this work?","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_forensics"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^Has anything in the flow looked wrong to you?","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_patterns"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^Does any of this worry you?","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_concerns"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^How would you follow money through a mixer?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},"ev","str","^It's over upstairs. You should know what you've been drawing.","/str",{"VAR?":"satoshi_confronted"},{"VAR?":"analyst_told"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":5},"ev","str","^Thanks for your time.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"forensics_discussion"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"pattern_concerns"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"personal_concerns"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"mixer_matching"},null],"c-4":["\n",{"->":"told_what_she_drew"},null],"c-5":["\n","#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Mm. Ta.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"forensics_discussion":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_forensics","re":true},"^Priya Raghavan: Oh, it's brilliant. Every transaction's public. Knowing whose it is, that's the hard bit.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: You watch how wallets behave, group the ones that move together, and line up the timings.","\n","ev","str","^Can you trace privacy coins like Monero?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What patterns indicate illegal activity?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"monero_forensics"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"illegal_patterns"},null]}],null],"monero_forensics":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Not from outside. Ring signatures, stealth addresses. It's a black box.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: But we're the door either side of it. Bitcoin in, Monero in the middle, Bitcoin out.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: The chain can't see the middle. Our own logs can.","\n","ev","str","^So your logs can see what the chain can't?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then whoever has your logs has everything.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Priya Raghavan: Every hop of it.","\n",{"->":"internal_logs_value"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Priya Raghavan: Yeah. Don't put that in your report.","\n",{"->":"internal_logs_value"},null]}],null],"internal_logs_value":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: With our logs you can unmix anything we've ever processed.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Which is why Irina guards them like a dragon. Privacy customers would riot.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"illegal_patterns":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Big mixing with no business reason. Amounts sitting just under the reporting line.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: And timing. Unrelated wallets that mix at the same time, same sort of amount? They aren't unrelated.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"violations_discussion":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: We file suspicious activity reports most weeks.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Privacy mixing gets a certain clientele. Most of it's legal, mind.","\n",{"->":"methodology_discussion"},null],"methodology_discussion":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Map who's connected to who, then check whether they move at the same times, then look at the amounts.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Anything odd goes to Irina. She decides what gets reported.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"suspicious_patterns":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Same habit every time. In, mixed, and gone by midnight.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Three of them have names on. Another twelve million or so since January hasn't.","\n","ev","str","^Where's the money going?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Have you reported this?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"destination_discussion"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"reporting_status"},null]}],null],"destination_discussion":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: That's the weird bit. I lose it in the mixer. But the shape says it all ends up in one place.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Different wallets in, and I'd bet one wallet out. Either someone's pooling it, or...","\n","ev","str","^Or what?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Did you flag this to Irina?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"coordinated_funding"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"irina_flagging"},null]}],null],"coordinated_funding":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Or lots of little groups are paying into one big one.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: That's the shape you get with organised crime. Or worse.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: I hope Irina knows what she's doing with it.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"irina_flagging":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Fortnight ago. She took it off me and did it herself.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Hasn't said what she found. Just \"keep watching\".","\n","ev","str","^Does she seem concerned?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What's your read on it?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"irina_concern"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"analyst_opinion"},null]}],null],"irina_concern":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Hard to tell. Irina's always intense.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: But she's been here till all hours, re-running my work. Either she's thorough or it's eating her.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"analyst_opinion":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: It looks bad.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Anywhere else, I'd call it a criminal network paying itself.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: But Satoshi says we're legit, and Irina signs off our compliance. So I'm trying not to jump.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"reporting_status":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Flagged to Irina. She hasn't sent anything outside yet.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: So either it's fine or she's building a case. She's cleverer than me, so I trust her. Mostly.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"pattern_concerns":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","#","^complete_task:question_the_analyst","/#","#","^set_variable:analyst_walked_through=true","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_patterns","re":true},"^Priya Raghavan: Look at this. Three wallets with names, plus a load without. ","#","^delivery: pointing something out","/#","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Into our mixer on a schedule, out the other side. And I'd swear it lands in the same place.","\n","ev","str","^What do you think it means?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Can you identify the source wallets?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"pattern_interpretation"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"source_identification"},null]}],null],"pattern_interpretation":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Lots of income streams feeding one pot. Could be a business with one accounts team.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Could be a criminal network pooling its money. Depends who owns the wallets.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"source_identification":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: They name themselves! Somebody paid for vanity wallets with ENTROPY in the address.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: It's all in my write-up on the desk. Take it.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Where it lands, the chain can't tell me. Somewhere in our own cold slots.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Irina sees who's behind the addresses. I just see shapes.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"mixer_matching":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","#","^complete_task:question_the_analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: You can't see through Monero. You don't need to. Watch what goes in and what comes out.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: The pool takes a cut and holds every coin a minimum time. So money comes out a bit lighter, and never early.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Same amount less the cut, after the hold, that's a match. Same slot three times, that's your wallet.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: The cut, the hold and the credits are on the transaction server in the data centre. I'm not allowed in. A regulator might be.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"personal_concerns":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_concerns","re":true},"^Priya Raghavan: I love this job. I love privacy tech. I believe in what we're meant to be doing.","\n","ev","str","^But?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What's keeping you up?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"but_response"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"worry_response"},null]}],null],"but_response":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: But some of these patterns frighten me. I might be drawing graphs of something awful.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: And I tell myself it's Irina's call. I'm just the analyst.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: That's starting to sound like an excuse.","\n",{"->":"moral_conflict"},null],"worry_response":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: That we sell privacy and some customers are buying cover.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: And they're not idealists.","\n",{"->":"moral_conflict"},null],"moral_conflict":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: That's why you're here, isn't it? The FCA doesn't turn up at a place our size for nowt.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: Someone thinks we're dirty.","\n","ev","str","^I can't talk about that.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You tell me. Is it?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"professional_response"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"direct_question"},null]}],null],"professional_response":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Priya Raghavan: Right. Professional. ","#","^delivery: with a bitter laugh","/#","\n","^Priya Raghavan: When you're done, tell me whether I've been helping criminals. I'd like to know what I've been drawing.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null],"direct_question":["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","^Narrator: She's quiet for a long moment.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: I think some customers would horrify me if I knew the details. I think Irina knows more than she says.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: And I think Satoshi cares more about his ideas than what they cost. So, yeah. Probably.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null],"told_what_she_drew":[["#","^speaker:analyst","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"analyst_told","re":true},"^Priya Raghavan: Go on, then.","\n","^Narrator: You tell her what the round sums were: ENTROPY's money, washed through the mixer and out to their cells.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: The big round sums. Every evening. I drew them as dots and gave them nice colours.","\n","^Priya Raghavan: And Irina signed every one off.","\n","ev","str","^Your graph is how we found it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You flagged it. She buried it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Priya Raghavan: Doesn't feel like much, from this side. Ta for telling me yourself, though.","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Priya Raghavan: I flagged it to the one person paid to bury it. I'll be thinking about that for a while.","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},null],"g-0":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"topic_forensics"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_patterns"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_concerns"},true,{"VAR=":"first_meeting"},false,{"VAR=":"analyst_spoken"},false,{"VAR=":"hub_quiet"},0,{"VAR=":"irina_news"},"str","^Agent 0x00","/str",{"VAR=":"player_name"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_arrested"},false,{"VAR=":"irina_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"satoshi_confronted"},false,{"VAR=":"analyst_told"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}
